Z||000000||lowfunds||11-10-2000||11:14 AM||||I plan on getting 17x7 for my 87gt, my question is what size tire would work best. I know the 215/45-17 will work fine, my question is will the 235/40s work ok without rubbing the fender well? The car is also lowered 1 1/2 all around. thanks for any help||||reg||1
Z||000001||1FST2M6||11-10-2000||11:19 AM||||they will not rub the fender but won't fit on your wheel right.. you'll need an 8" wheel for a 235. 215s are fine! I've got 215s in the front and235s out back on my 8.5" wheel<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstlow.jpg" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstlow.jpg</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Will||11-10-2000||11:27 AM||||1FSTSM6:<P>     Those are very nice wheels. Are they 1pc or 2-3 pc? I'm looking for 17 x 9.5 for the rear when I get my SLA suspension done. I'd like to run 275/40's.<BR>     In your experience, what's the widest wheel that can be run on the front? I'd like to be able to run 245/45's tires.<BR>     Thanks for your response to my post on ls6.com. It was much more constructive than the responses I got in the import forum. I'll check out that link.||||reg||1
Z||000003||1FST2M6||11-10-2000||11:34 AM||||HEH..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> sure!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  i had 235s on the front for a short time.. but lost them along with the 255s when i hit a door in the HWY. i went to 215s and 245. the GT has 215s and 235s. a 275 is a HUGE @$$ tire! you sure you really want that much? the rotating weight on somthing like that is INSANE! with 310lbft of tq i had a hard time breaking 255s loose! it would do it but *****  about it! had NASTY wheel hop! a 245 was nice but still complained! they are 2 piece Enkei Phalnex. <A HREF="http://www.enkei.com" TARGET=_blank>www.enkei.com</A>  with Dunlop W10s. a 275 is a LOT of meat.. GEZZ!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> James checks hi e-mail often and is VERY knowledgable. you can also contact Ed at <A HREF="http://www.engineered.net" TARGET=_blank>www.engineered.net</A>  <P><BR>love your occupation!!  assasin!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> LMAO!<p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 11-10-2000).]||||reg||1
